\pard\sa160\sb280\b\f1\fs34\cf1 5. Functional Implementation & Clinical Workflows\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 5.1 Patient Workflow\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
\pard\li480\sa80 1. Registration & Auth: Secure account creation issuing short-lived JWT access tokens (15-min) and long-lived refresh tokens with automatic silent rotation.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 2. Appointment Booking: Real-time doctor directory search filtered by department. The system calculates available 30-minute time slots (09:00 - 17:00), excluding Sundays, past times, and booked appointments. A conditional database constraint prevents duplicate scheduling while permitting re-booking of cancelled slots.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 3. Medical Records & AI Summary: Patients can upload lab test PDFs or images. The backend extracts text and invokes an AI summarization pipeline translating complex diagnostic metrics into plain language.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 4. Billing & Settlement: Auto-generated consultation invoices are displayed with itemized charges. Patients can complete dummy digital payments with instant receipt status updates.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 5. 24/7 AI Health Assistant: Chatbot equipped with emergency guardrails. Queries mentioning chest pain, severe bleeding, or unconsciousness trigger instant emergency warnings, bypassing LLM queries.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 5.2 Doctor Clinical Suite\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
\pard\li480\sa80 1. Verification Gate: Newly registered doctors remain unapproved until credentials are reviewed by the Medical Administrator.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 2. Daily Schedule: Live calendar displaying daily patient queues with quick-action status toggles (SCHEDULED, COMPLETED, CANCELLED).\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 3. Clinical Examination & Prescriptions: Attending doctors review past medical history, enter symptoms and clinical observations, and prescribe medicines.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 4. Automated Billing Signal: Upon saving a prescription, a Django post_save signal triggers apps.billing.signals, creating an itemized invoice for ₹500.00 and dispatching an asynchronous patient notification via Celery.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 5.3 Hospital Administrator Command Center\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
\pard\li480\sa80 1. Executive Dashboard: Live metrics displaying total patient count, active physicians, today's appointments, and monthly revenue.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 2. Staff Credentialing: One-click Doctor Approval / Rejection with automated audit logging.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 3. Knowledge Base Governance: Admins upload hospital policies, FAQs, and protocol PDFs. Documents are chunked (500 tokens) and indexed into vector embeddings for grounded AI assistant retrieval.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 4. HIPAA Audit Trail: Immutable audit logs capturing every login, appointment booking, clinical consultation, and invoice payment with user IP addresses and timestamps.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
