\pard\sa160\sb280\b\f1\fs34\cf1 6. End-to-End DevOps & Automation Pipeline Deep-Dive\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 6.1 Phase 1: Git Version Control & Branching Strategy\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Repository Setup: Hosted on GitHub with clean .gitignore isolating virtual environments, SQLite, node_modules, and media assets.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Branch Topology:\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  main: Production release branch. Protected against unverified direct commits.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  develop: Nightly staging and feature integration branch.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  feature/*: Granular feature branches merged via verified Pull Requests.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Commit Standards: Semantic commits (feat:, fix:, ci:, docs:) enforce readable project evolution.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 6.2 Phase 2: Jenkins Declarative CI Pipeline\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
The pipeline is governed by a declarative [Jenkinsfile](file:///c:/Users/sam/Desktop/MediFlow-AI/Jenkinsfile) executing across 7 automated stages:\par 
\pard\li480\sa80 1. SCM Checkout: Clones target branch and captures Git commit metadata.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 2. Code Quality: Parallel syntax compilation across all 167 backend Python files and frontend configuration integrity validation.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 3. Automated Testing: Pytest runs unit and integration tests across Auth, Appointments, Billing, and AI Assistant modules.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 4. Frontend Packaging: Validates Vite production build assets and ensures 0 broken module imports across 78 JS/JSX files.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 5. DevSecOps Gate: Secret key isolation verification ensuring zero hardcoded credentials.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 6. Docker Packaging: Builds hospital_ai_backend and hospital_ai_frontend dual-tagged with $\{BUILD_NUMBER\} and latest.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80 7. Clean-up: cleanWs frees build executor disk storage upon pipeline completion.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 6.3 Phase 3: Docker Containerization\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Backend Dockerfile: Multi-stage image running on python:3.11-slim, installing OS dependencies (libpq-dev, gcc), caching pip dependencies, and exposing port 8000.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Frontend Dockerfile: Two-stage build compiling React assets using Node 18 Alpine and serving optimized static bundles via high-performance Nginx Alpine on port 80.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Docker Compose: Multi-container orchestration managing 6 interdependent services: db, redis, backend, celery_worker, celery_beat, and frontend.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 6.4 Phase 4: Kubernetes Cluster Orchestration\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
Deployed under the isolated mediflow namespace via declarative YAMLs:\par 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  postgres-pv-pvc.yaml: 5Gi Persistent Volume with ReadWriteOnce access mode, ensuring clinical patient records survive pod restarts.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  backend.yaml: Scalable Deployment (2 replicas) equipped with HTTP livenessProbe and readinessProbe on /api/departments/, guaranteeing zero traffic hits unready pods.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  frontend.yaml & Service: NodePort service exposing the UI externally on port 30080.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  ingress.yaml: Unified ingress controller routing /api requests to backend pods and / requests to frontend pods.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  hpa.yaml: Horizontal Pod Autoscaler monitoring CPU metrics to scale backend replicas from 2 to 5 automatically under heavy hospital traffic.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 6.5 Phase 5: Ansible Configuration Management\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
Playbooks in ansible/playbooks/ deliver automated, idempotent server provisioning:\par 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  01-docker-install.yml: Installs Docker CE, containerd, and Docker Compose plugin on Ubuntu nodes.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  02-k8s-install.yml: Disables system swap and provisions lightweight Kubernetes runtime (k3s).\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  03-app-deploy.yml: Clones the Git repository and executes kubectl apply -f k8s/.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  04-system-hardening.yml: Configures UFW firewall, restricting open ports strictly to 22, 80, 443, and 30080.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 6.6 Phase 6: Terraform Infrastructure as Code (IaC)\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
Modular Terraform scripts in terraform/ guarantee reproducible cloud deployments:\par 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  modules/vpc: Provisions VPC (10.0.0.0/16), Public Subnet (10.0.1.0/24), Internet Gateway, and Route Tables.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  modules/security: Provisions Security Groups allowing controlled inbound traffic.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  modules/compute: Deploys an AWS EC2 instance (t3.medium) running Ubuntu 22.04 LTS with automated startup user-data scripts.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 6.7 Phase 7 & 8: Observability & Logging (Prometheus, Grafana, Loki)\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Prometheus: Scrapes application metrics from Django backend, container metrics from cAdvisor, and host metrics from Node Exporter every 15s.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Alert Rules: Configured in alert_rules.yml for HighCpuUsage (>85%), ContainerDown, and HighHttp5xxErrors.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Grafana: Live dashboards visualizing real-time CPU gauge, RAM consumption, and HTTP request throughput.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Loki & Promtail: Centralized log streaming capturing Django audit trails and Nginx access logs without heavy index overhead.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 6.8 Phase 9: DevSecOps & Security Posture\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  SonarQube (sonar-project.properties): Enforces Static Application Security Testing (SAST) quality gates.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Trivy Container Scanner (trivy-scan.sh): Scans Docker images for Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVEs).\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Role-Based Access Control (RBAC): Backend permissions (IsPatient, IsApprovedDoctor, IsAdmin) strictly enforce data boundaries across roles.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 6.9 Phase 10: Zero-Downtime Blue-Green Deployment\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
Configured in k8s/blue-green-deployment.yaml:\par 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Blue Deployment: Live production version (v1.0.0).\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Green Deployment: Newly staged release (v2.0.0).\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  Traffic Cutover: Switching version: blue to version: green in the router service instantly redirects user traffic with 0 dropped requests and 0ms downtime.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\sa120\sb200\b\f1\fs28\cf2 6.10 Phase 11: GitOps Continuous Delivery (ArgoCD)\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
Configured in k8s/argocd-app.yaml:\par 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  ArgoCD continuously reconciles the live Kubernetes cluster with the k8s/ directory in Git.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  selfHeal: true automatically corrects manual configuration drift on the cluster.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
