\pard\sa160\sb280\b\f1\fs34\cf1 8. Engineering Challenges & Troubleshooting Log\b0\fs22\cf0\par\pard\sl276\slmult1\f0 
\par 
\pard\li480\sa80 1. Appointment Cancellation Slot Collision:\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  *Problem:* A unique constraint on (doctor, appointment_date, appointment_time) prevented booking a slot that had previously been cancelled.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  *Resolution:* Converted the model constraint into a conditional models.UniqueConstraint(fields=[...], condition=Q(status='SCHEDULED')), allowing cancelled slots to be immediately re-booked.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\li480\sa80 2. Cross-Role AI Assistant 403 & Profile Missing Exceptions:\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  *Problem:* The AI Assistant view was hardcoded to IsPatient and attempted to access request.user.patient_profile, crashing when doctors accessed clinical protocol queries.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  *Resolution:* Added an optional user ForeignKey to the Message model and configured permissions to [IsPatient | IsApprovedDoctor], gracefully supporting both roles.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\li480\sa80 3. Persistent Database Storage in Kubernetes:\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  *Problem:* Default container restarts wipe Postgres clinical records.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  *Resolution:* Provisioned standard Persistent Volumes (postgres-pv-pvc.yaml) binding 5Gi of persistent host storage to /var/lib/postgresql/data.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
\pard\li480\sa80 4. Zero-Downtime Blue-Green Routing:\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  *Problem:* Ensuring seamless cutover between application releases without restarting pods.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\pard\li480\sa80\bullet  *Resolution:* Implemented label-based service routing (app: backend-live, version: blue/green), allowing instant zero-downtime traffic switching via kubectl patch service.\par\pard\sl276\slmult1 
\par 
